        "value": "[{'stage': 'Electrical Rough-In / Equipment Set', 'description': 'Inspector checks generator location, working clearances, transfer switch installation, feeder/conduit sizing, grounding and bonding, disconnecting means, labeling, and that the generator is not placed too close to openings or fresh-air intakes.', 'timing': 'Before final energization and before concealment of any wiring or conduit'}, {'stage': 'Gas Rough-In / Pressure Test', 'description': 'Inspector verifies new gas piping size, approved materials, shutoff valve location, sediment trap if required by appliance listing, pressure test results, support/strapping, and proper connection to the generator fuel inlet.', 'timing': 'Before the gas line is covered and before the generator is placed into service'}, {'stage': 'Final Electrical / Final Gas', 'description': 'Inspector confirms ATS operation, transfer sequence, labeling, generator start-up, emergency shutdown access, final gas appliance connection, leak-free joints, and that the unit is installed at a safe setback from doors, windows, and HVAC intakes.', 'timing': 'After all equipment is installed and operational'}]"
